# wedged the <<MACHINE_2_ID>> daemon for 2h+ every 5-min tick (pma-supervisor-verify.{json,md}, ahead 14/
# behind 485) on 2026-08-15. keep-ours resolves deterministically: the target (sole runner) keeps
